{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#2840","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#2840","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#2840\",\"parent_revision\":\"3efb18a866b01f32fb948dad5614c03c20d6698e7e77f45239b84800a8620dbc\",\"root_revision\":\"3efb18a866b01f32fb948dad5614c03c20d6698e7e77f45239b84800a8620dbc\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: open\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Suggested Next Step\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nInvestigate whether a newer `nodejs-wheel-binaries` release ships a wheel for this platform/Python combo, or whether a version pin/workaround (e.g. pointing at system Node via an env var, or a `basedpyright` alternative) is needed. Root cause beyond the captured build log is not yet investigated.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Problem\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n`uv sync` (and therefore `uv run prek run ...`) fails on this local macOS worktree because `nodejs-wheel-binaries` (a transitive dependency of `basedpyright`) has no prebuilt wheel for this Python/platform combination and falls back to a CMake/make source build of Node.js from source. That build fails with 2 compiler errors: Xcode's Clang treats OpenSSL 3.0 deprecated-API warnings as fatal (`DH_free`, `EC_KEY_free`, `HMAC_CTX_free` in `deps/ncrypto/ncrypto.cc`), via `-Wdeprecated-declarations` promoted to `[-Werror]`-equivalent by the build config.\\n\\nResult: `uv sync` aborts before installing any dev-group package \u2014 `.venv/bin/` ends up with no `pytest`, `ruff`, etc. \u2014 blocking all local Python tooling on this machine.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Evidence\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nCaptured build tail (from `uv sync` / `uv run prek run --files ...`):\\n\\n```\\n../deps/ncrypto/ncrypto.h:217:39: warning: 'EC_KEY_free' is deprecated [-Wdeprecated-declarations]\\n...\\n81 warnings and 2 errors generated.\\nmake[1]: *** [.../obj.target/ncrypto/deps/ncrypto/ncrypto.o] Error 1\\nmake: *** [node] Error 2\\n*** CMake build failed\\n\\nhint: `nodejs-wheel-binaries` (v24.16.0) was included because `claude-skills:dev` (v0.1.0) depends on `basedpyright` (v1.39.9) which depends on `nodejs-wheel-binaries`\\n```\\n</div>\\n\\n## Discovered While\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nWorking issue #2839 (unrelated). Worked around by validating exclusively via GitHub Actions CI (ubuntu-latest runners are unaffected \u2014 they have a prebuilt wheel).\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"93ec2cb1dfe6e5afa226341e237b3c315b51481ea755e098da681bfd36730cac\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABSdqLlg\"}"}